# The one credential this project uses. Two commands read it, both run by
# hand, both committing what they produce:
#
#   rag-contract build-index     embeds the corpus and the question set
#   rag-contract record-drafts   records the answer model's claims as fixtures
#
# Everything else — the evals, the gate, CI — runs off those committed
# artefacts and needs no key at all.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# The daily spend cap is deliberately not here. It used to be, as
# DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD, and nothing read it. Wiring it up in place would have
# made the cap whatever the machine running the command happened to say, which
# is invisible in review and different for everyone. It is budget.daily_cap_usd
# in eval/thresholds.yaml instead, next to every other bar this project is held
# to, so that raising it is a diff. There is no environment override.
